      <activity id="d8f67ca0-ca08-596f-816b-2e1080780025" activityNameId="d3b2d117-9734-57e9-acf2-c04ffe083805" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fluorescent whitening agent distyrylbiphenyl type, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fluorescent whitening agent distyrylbiphenyl type, at plant
data based on company information for a former detergent study of EMPA;
CAS number: 027344-41-8; 
Synonyms: DSBP; 
UUID: d3f70cf6-1f16-3096-9e1a-212f70b17aa7
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of the mentioned FWA (fluorescent whitening agent). Transport and infrastructure have been estimated.
Location: data from European main producer, used as European average
Technology: Typcial production process for end of 90s
Time period: year of reported data
Production volume: 250000000
Sampling: aggregated data, calculated by the producing company itself 
Extrapolations: see geography and technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d3f70cf6-1f16-3096-9e1a-212f70b17aa7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
